id: pm-beads-hsjo
title: Use SDK certification for complete Beads workspace reads
description: "2026-10-25 SDK adoption audit: replace assertListAllComplete duplication with inspectCompleteListResult while retaining package error classification; verify the audited locator is already replaced by locateItem plus resolveItemTypeRegistry in item-access.ts on main. Related SDK adoption: pm-beads-8wev; remaining host API gaps: pm-beads-z4k0. Prove public tracker differential parity and each intentional SDK contract difference, behavioral revert, unchanged full coverage and npm/Bun release gates."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[1]: sdk-adoption
