author: codex-agent
parent: pm-beads-8wev
resolution: "PR #174 merged at 2026-10-25T16:50:24Z: SDK inspectCompleteListResult owns complete-list certification; configured item lookup uses locateItem and resolveItemTypeRegistry. Differential and revert receipts cover both public corpora and the stricter refusals. The documented strict budget-disclosure compatibility predicate and cold-cache SDK gap remain explicit, separate follow-ups. README removes the nonexistent beadsTransferItemId export."
expected_result: "All acceptance criteria and the declared audit scope are proven on current main, with explicit SDK and broader-project boundaries."
actual_result: "Verified current main contains merged PR #174 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/pull/174), merge commit f345866a0e9b523b1cfc65968d8d113bd81007c0, merged_at 2026-10-25T16:50:24Z. Inspected index.ts, item-access.ts, test/list-all-refusals.test.ts and examples/sdk-adoption-validation.md. SDK inspectCompleteListResult owns complete-list certification; configured item lookup uses locateItem and resolveItemTypeRegistry. Differential and revert receipts cover both public corpora and the stricter refusals. The documented strict budget-disclosure compatibility predicate and cold-cache SDK gap remain explicit, separate follow-ups. README removes the nonexistent beadsTransferItemId export. Linked focused verification passed: npm run build && node --test test/list-all-refusals.test.ts test/item-access.test.ts. No product source behavior changed in this closure branch. Full npm and Bun release gates are reserved for CI; no new behavioral revert applies to tracker-only changes."
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T16:12:19.191Z",codex-agent,"Baseline origin/main 5563525 already deletes locateItemFile: item-access.ts delegates lookup to locateItem with settings.id_prefix, settings.item_format and resolveItemTypeRegistry(settings).type_to_folder, and SDK history verification. No timestamp patching or history repair will be introduced. Remaining replacement: inspectCompleteListResult with package IncompleteWorkspaceReadError presentation. Keep pinned SDK 2026.10.20 unchanged (published host checked: 2026.10.25). Differential validation will build the immutable baseline, copy public GitHub tracker trees into non-git scratch directories, compare export/diff/validation and verified item reads, and fingerprint inputs before/after."
  "2026-10-25T16:16:57.494Z",codex-agent,"Replacement implemented: 189 lines removed from index.ts and a small SDK inspection adapter added; synchronous compatibility calls now request strict-read/no-truncate while initialized async workflows already use PmClient.listAllComplete. README documents SDK scope/projection/session/identity strictness and SDK diagnostics, plus informational non-omitting budget receipt semantics. Focused command node --test test/list-all-refusals.test.ts test/smoke.test.ts test/export-diff-paths.test.ts test/import-paths.test.ts test/tracker-configurations.test.ts test/item-access.test.ts passes 242/242, zero skipped. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test and npm run docstring pass; no lint script exists, docstring is the configured source lint gate."
  "2026-10-25T16:16:59.081Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof for the complete-list replacement: restored only assertListAllComplete from immutable main 5563525, leaving new regression cases and request flags unchanged. Command: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"filters |projection selects|projection omits|applied_limit|read_session|identities differ\" test/list-all-refusals.test.ts. Result: 11/11 selected tests FAIL, all missing expected refusal. Restoring the SDK adapter makes node --test test/list-all-refusals.test.ts pass 57/57. No tracker history or item document was reverted. The locator finding has no new replacement to revert: it was already adopted on baseline main in #165; current configuration matrix passes 20/20 and item-access tests 4/4."
  "2026-10-25T16:17:38.946Z",codex-agent,"Line-count correction: git diff --numstat reports index.ts +17/-172 (155 net lines removed), rather than the 189 changed-line total quoted earlier. Audit predicates and their presentation branches are deleted; the remaining adapter delegates every admission decision to the SDK."
  "2026-10-25T16:19:28.008Z",codex-agent,"Public differential PASS on immutable pm-beads main 556352541cf8a9e01c9813534f9f5896d3ba4235 (tracker tree 7e3fa14a5dc838480739053fc19f8c0519ea54bd, 102 items) and pm-changelog main fa8a8a1d0af97797e6a34a78bdd6b9b30242378e (tracker tree e7733dfe89c9e72355fce4d8df0087a398754ab7, 197 items). Commands: node test/public-sdk-differential.ts; node test/public-sdk-differential.ts <public-package-checkout> unbraind/pm-changelog. Both build immutable baseline main and compare six read output groups on read-only non-git copies with git absent from PATH: full serialization, filtered serialization, every verified document/history, export, workspace diff, validation. Zero successful-output differences across 299 items. Fifteen receipt cases per corpus list eleven stricter cases and one informational budget acceptance difference; all are documented in examples/sdk-adoption-validation.md. Both tracker digests and source trees remain unchanged. Derived SDK caches are warmed before the read-only snapshot (known pm-beads-w90u). Linked pm test run also passes 242/242."
  "2026-10-25T16:19:31.410Z",codex-agent,"Strict tracker health passes with a fresh home and system/global git config disabled, matching CI isolation. Ordinary host home discovers a global pm-github extension requiring host 2026.10.25 while this package pins 2026.10.20; that ambient extension skew is absent in isolated health. No package pin, extension policy, telemetry setting or existing history was changed."
  "2026-10-25T16:26:02.334Z",codex-agent,"Final compatibility correction from differential review: preserve the original refusal of ANY output_budget_truncation/output_budget_exceeded key, including null, undefined and informational non-omitting values. The SDK inspectCompleteListResult API lacks an option requiring disclosure keys to be absent (needed capability: strict-disclosure-presence policy, e.g. rejectBudgetDisclosures). This one package compatibility presence predicate remains; every source/scope/page/projection/count/identity certification predicate is replaced by the SDK. The orchestrator can report the named SDK option gap upstream. There is no admission relaxation in the final design. Updated source delta: +23/-172, 149 net lines removed from index.ts. Added explicit compatibility regressions; current receipt/seam suite passes 58/58. Prior full-gate run was superseded before completion and will be rerun on this final design."
  "2026-10-25T16:28:03.962Z",codex-agent,"Final-design differential rerun passes both public corpora (299 items, six identical successful output groups each). All 15 receipt cases per corpus now have only 11 stricter admission differences; informational budget receipts keep their original refusal. No admission relaxation remains. Behavioral revert rerun on final adapter again fails all 11 selected strictness regressions, restoring it passes 58/58 receipt/seam cases. Typecheck and test typecheck pass. The full npm then Bun release gates are running on this frozen code; the review PR will expose CI release-gate results."
  "2026-10-25T16:34:51.990Z",codex-agent,"PR ready for review: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/pull/174 at implementation commit 0cc7c326e8064e101424c8d891653918b104fe36. Full CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/40211860833 succeeds: npm and Bun each pass 505/505 tests on Node 22 and 26, zero skips/failures; all 14 required source files report 100% lines, branches and functions with unchanged thresholds. Job logs inspected for both matrix entries, including both release-gate test summaries, strict tracker health, production audit, package dry-run, changelog, attestation and release-date checks. Local isolated npm run release:check also passes the same 505/505 and 100% metrics; local Bun gate is running. No merge or release. Only remaining adoption exception is the strict-disclosure-presence SDK option gap already recorded."
  "2026-10-25T16:42:07.100Z",codex-agent,"Final local gates PASS on unchanged production code: env with fresh home and disabled global/system git config, npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each 505/505 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, all 14 required source files at 100% lines/branches/functions. Both include typecheck, build, docstring source lint, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), package dry-run, changelog check and release attestation/date checks. Full CI source-head evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/40211860833, npm plus Bun on Node 22/26 with identical counts and coverage. Differential and revert proofs are in examples/sdk-adoption-validation.md. Implementation commit 0cc7c326e8064e101424c8d891653918b104fe36; PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/pull/174. Handoff changes only evidence/tracker state; production code is frozen. Leave this item open for orchestrator verification; release the claim. Open SDK gap: inspectCompleteListResult lacks strict-disclosure-presence option, so the original budget-key absence policy is retained. Known cold-cache read-only limitation remains pm-beads-w90u. No merge/release and no upstream issue filed."
  "2026-10-26T08:21:28.704Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main contains merged PR #174 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/pull/174), merge commit f345866a0e9b523b1cfc65968d8d113bd81007c0, merged_at 2026-10-25T16:50:24Z. Inspected index.ts, item-access.ts, test/list-all-refusals.test.ts and examples/sdk-adoption-validation.md. SDK inspectCompleteListResult owns complete-list certification; configured item lookup uses locateItem and resolveItemTypeRegistry. Differential and revert receipts cover both public corpora and the stricter refusals. The documented strict budget-disclosure compatibility predicate and cold-cache SDK gap remain explicit, separate follow-ups. README removes the nonexistent beadsTransferItemId export. Plan: run the linked focused verification on unchanged main sources; append only tracker evidence, regenerate the repository changelog and submit a closure PR for full CI."
  "2026-10-26T08:25:02.116Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main contains merged PR #174 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/pull/174), merge commit f345866a0e9b523b1cfc65968d8d113bd81007c0, merged_at 2026-10-25T16:50:24Z. Inspected index.ts, item-access.ts, test/list-all-refusals.test.ts and examples/sdk-adoption-validation.md. SDK inspectCompleteListResult owns complete-list certification; configured item lookup uses locateItem and resolveItemTypeRegistry. Differential and revert receipts cover both public corpora and the stricter refusals. The documented strict budget-disclosure compatibility predicate and cold-cache SDK gap remain explicit, separate follow-ups. README removes the nonexistent beadsTransferItemId export. Linked focused verification passed: npm run build && node --test test/list-all-refusals.test.ts test/item-access.test.ts. No product source behavior changed in this closure branch. Full npm and Bun release gates are reserved for CI; no new behavioral revert applies to tracker-only changes."
